1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,970
So I've got two kinds of Prince
Rupert drops that I made here

2
00:00:02,970 --> 00:00:07,007
and a vessel in which
to demonstrate here.

3
00:00:11,579 --> 00:00:13,581
So first I'm going to show you--

4
00:00:13,581 --> 00:00:17,918
they both cool rather quickly,
but one was cooled in air.

5
00:00:17,918 --> 00:00:21,088
One was cooled in water.

6
00:00:21,088 --> 00:00:25,326
This is the one
that's cooled in air.

7
00:00:25,326 --> 00:00:27,895
And by the way, I used to
give a demo in the Glass Lab

8
00:00:27,895 --> 00:00:31,031
where I would take the
Prince Rupert drop,

9
00:00:31,031 --> 00:00:33,434
put it on a sealed table
that we call the marver,

10
00:00:33,434 --> 00:00:35,536
and hit it with a hammer
as hard as I could.

11
00:00:35,536 --> 00:00:38,639
I was never able to shatter
this head with a hammer.

12
00:00:38,639 --> 00:00:40,941
In fact, I dented the
marver so many times

13
00:00:40,941 --> 00:00:43,377
that I stopped doing that demo.

14
00:00:43,377 --> 00:00:47,114
So I have a different way
of doing it now which is--

15
00:00:47,114 --> 00:00:48,716
I won't do that today,
but usually I'll

16
00:00:48,716 --> 00:00:50,985
have a student come and try
to break the Prince Rupert

17
00:00:50,985 --> 00:00:52,086
drop in their hands.

18
00:00:52,086 --> 00:00:53,287
It's really hard to do.

19
00:00:53,287 --> 00:00:54,788
Most people can't do it.

20
00:00:54,788 --> 00:00:57,558
But the air-cooled
Prince Rupert drop

21
00:00:57,558 --> 00:00:59,226
doesn't have the same
kind of strength.

22
00:00:59,226 --> 00:01:00,694
So watch what happens.

23
00:01:05,165 --> 00:01:08,636
Not much.

24
00:01:08,636 --> 00:01:10,004
Well, let's try down farther.

25
00:01:10,004 --> 00:01:11,338
Maybe there's more stress there.

26
00:01:14,008 --> 00:01:15,709
Nope, not [INAUDIBLE].

27
00:01:18,812 --> 00:01:21,448
Let me try one more time.

28
00:01:21,448 --> 00:01:23,817
Maybe where it's thicker maybe
there will be more stress.

29
00:01:27,755 --> 00:01:31,224
Maybe a little.
